{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F2pSH9Cspu1795422163.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超在政府總部，與參加上海世界技能大賽香港代表團會面，祝賀港隊創下歷屆最佳成績。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「香港的選手憑藉，精湛工藝和拼搏精神，在大賽中刷新香港歷屆最佳成績，包括在軌道車輛技術項目奪得銀牌，並在14個項目中奪得優異獎章。你們向世界展現香港年輕一代的優秀技能和才華，以實際行動說好香港故事。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CE-1600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cQSotpitG91795422166.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今屆世界技能大賽，港隊派出41名選手，於37個項目，取得一銀、十四優異獎章，參賽人數和項目數量歷來最多。</p><p></p><p>李家超表示，政府會繼續推動職業專才教育，培育各行業實用型技術人才。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.390441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.072729+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:15.290022+00:00","content_hash":"04953caed0cca62df446607bd86926dc9dc5a214da517e7ac32e56237fc34f21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.390441+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}